            "conclusion": "Reject H0 (p = 2.140e-36 < 0.05). Having a partner significantly reduces churn risk (churn rate: 19.7% for partnered vs 33.0% for unpartnered)."
        },
        "mann_whitney_monthly_charges": {
            "test_name": "Mann-Whitney U Test (MonthlyCharges by Churn Status)",
